# Bench: TARGET PASS = fold (constant folding + propagation).
# expect: exit 13
# `2 + 3*4 - 1` is all constants: fold collapses mul=12, add=14, sub=13 into a
# single iconst chain. Metric: 3 arith instrs (mul/add/sub) become 3 iconsts ->
# the const-arith IR instruction count holds but the arith ops vanish; combined
# with later DCE the dead const feeders are pruned. At the fold stage the proof
# is the disappearance of mul/add/sub from --emit ir at -O1 vs -O0.
fn main() -> int {
    return 2 + 3 * 4 - 1
}
